{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"5403","title":"Xiaomi Launches REDMI 15C: Sleek Design Meets Immersive Display and Everyday Power","desc":"REDMI 15C combines a sleek, refined design with an expansive 6.9-inch immersive display to enhance everyday viewing. Backed by a large battery and fast charging, REDMI 15C is built to deliver reliable performance throughout the day.","view_cnt":"13798","like_cnt":"4","add_time":"1756713218","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/394_operatorx_operatorx_opx/01/09/2025/6dc454832b67d9f2738fbf1c46a7d6bb.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e[Beijing, China, September 1, 2025]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;— Xiaomi today introduced REDMI 15C, combining a sleek, refined design with an expansive 6.9-inch immersive display to enhance everyday viewing. Backed by a large battery and fast charging¹, REDMI 15C is built to deliver reliable performance throughout the day.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Calibri\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003eREDMI 15C features a slim body² with a 3D quad-curved back that feels smooth and balanced in the hand, complemented by a floating crater deco that adds subtle sophistication. It comes in four colors—Midnight Black, Mint Green, Moonlight Blue, and Twilight Orange³, with Moonlight Blue and Twilight Orange inspired by ocean tides and sunlight at different times of day, brought to life through a dual-color magnetic ink process.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/592_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/01/09/2025/aa9bf4c30347172bbc6cfe9a53189dbf.jpg\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003eAt the front, a spacious 6.9-inch HD+ display paired with an up to 120Hz AdaptiveSync refresh rate⁴ offers smooth, responsive visuals, and a 50MP AI dual camera captures crisp, detailed shots in various lighting conditions. Despite its slim build², REDMI 15C packs a high-capacity 6000mAh battery⁵—supporting up to 22 hours of video playback or 82 hours of music\u003c/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e⁶\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e. 33W turbo charging\u003c/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e¹\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;brings the battery to 50% in just 31 minutes\u003c/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e⁶\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e. For added flexibility, reverse charging⁷ allows REDMI 15C to power other devices when needed.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/681_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/01/09/2025/6a1bc57e2687512342454d0d5700529b.png\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003ePowered by the MediaTek Helio G81-Ultra processor, paired with up to 16GB of RAM⁸ via Memory extension and support for up to 1TB of expandable storage⁹, REDMI 15C delivers a smooth, responsive experience across daily apps, light gaming, and multitasking. It runs on Xiaomi HyperOS 2¹º with features like Circle to Search with Google¹¹ and Google Gemini integration¹² to enhance multitasking with intelligent assistance. Meanwhile, Xiaomi Interconnectivity features like Call sync and Shared clipboard\u003c/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e¹³ \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003emake it easier to move between phone, tablet, and PC.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Calibri\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003eIts IP64-rated dust and water resistance\u003c/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e¹⁴\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;allows the device to stand up to everyday splashes and dust. Meanwhile, a 200% volume boost\u003c/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e¹⁵ \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003emakes media playback and\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: 等线\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003ealerts easier to hear in noisy environments.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Calibri\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003eREDMI 15C is available in 4GB+128GB, 6GB+128GB, 4GB+256GB, and 8GB+256GB configurations\u003c/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e¹⁶\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e, starting from 119 USD. Pricing may vary by region.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Calibri\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e¹ Please consult the local seller on the availability of the power adapter in the box.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e² Product may vary by region, please refer to the actual product.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e³ Color availability may vary between regions.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e⁴ Refresh rate can be adjusted up to 120Hz for supported apps.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e⁵ Battery typical capacity is 6000mAh.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e⁶ Data obtained from Xiaomi Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e⁷ Supports up to 10W wired reverse charging, compatible with devices verified through Xiaomi Internal Labs testing. Actual performance may vary depending on battery conditions and other factors. When using this feature, please ensure your phone has sufficient battery and verify the compatibility of the receiving device.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e⁸ 16GB RAM with Memory extension is based on 8GB RAM version. Additional RAM will occupy a corresponding amount of ROM storage. Memory extension is only available when there is enough storage space on your device. Actual extension of RAM storage capacity varies across different models.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e⁹ microSD card for expandable storage sold separately, please refer to the actual use.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e¹º Availability of Xiaomi HyperOS 2 features, apps and services may vary depending on software version and phone model.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e¹¹ Available on select devices and internet connection required. Works on compatible apps and surfaces. Results may vary depending on visual matches.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e¹² Gemini mobile app available on select devices, languages and countries. Works with compatible accounts. Internet connection required. Check responses for accuracy. Feature availability varies based on language. Gemini is a trademark of LLC.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e¹³ Phones and tablets need to be upgraded to Xiaomi HyperOS 2 with Bluetooth and WLAN settings activated, log in to the same Xiaomi account, and make sure \"Settings-Xiaomi Interconnectivity\" is turned on. Availability of specific features, and services may vary depending on software version, apps and product model, please refer to the actual use.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e¹⁴ The device with IP64 has been tested to be resistant to splash and dust in the presence of specific laboratory conditions with the classification IP64 ingress protection based on IEC60529:1989+A1:1999+A2:2013.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e¹⁵ Data tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs, 200% volume boost refers to 16 levels of volume compared to 15 levels, and actual effects may vary due to software and scenarios, please refer to the actual use.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial\"\u003e¹⁶ Configurations available may differ between different regions. Available storage and RAM are less than the total memory due to storage of the operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"12479","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1756718076"},"common":null}